Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.12), python3-yaml, maluos-firstboot (>= 0.1.7), maluos-vault (>= 0.4.0), maluos-estate (>= 0.2.0)
Recommends: maluos-gateway (>= 0.3.4), maluos-agent (>= 0.4.0)
Description: MaluOS desk enrolment with a Business OS office: maluctl office
 A MaluOS desktop joins a Business OS office as a desk, a location in the
 office's estate that belongs to the person at the keyboard. `sudo maluctl
 office enroll URL --code CODE` exchanges a one-time code the office gave
 the person for a desk token, keeps the token in the person's vault
 compartment (office-desk-token), records the office and its endpoints in
 /etc/maluos/office.yaml and /etc/maluos/office.env (for agents), and makes
 the office's model endpoint a rung of this desk's inference gateway
 (--model office) that is applied with the token on the caller's behalf.
 .
 `maluctl office heartbeat` tells the office the desk is online (the
 desktop session sends one every few minutes while the person is signed
 in); `status` shows the enrolment and the office's view of it; `leave`
 retires the desk and removes everything enrolment added. A mock office
 (python3 -m maluos_desk.mock_office) implements the contract for tests.
